OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 83, offered morphine to woman
OL,4,Awho later died
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old man had admitted
OL,7,Foffering morphine to a woman who later
OL,8,Fdied.
OL,10,FLily Gomes, 27, from Hatfield,
OL,11,FHertfordshire, died in hospital on 18
OL,12,FFebruary 2025 from morphine toxicity.
OL,13,FShe had fallen unconscious at the home
OL,14,Fof Arthur Sutton, of Cotswolds,
OL,15,FHatfield, four days after he had
OL,16,Foffered her the drug.
OL,18,FOn Tuesday, at St Albans Crown Court,
OL,19,FSutton pleaded guilty to three counts
OL,20,Fof offering to supply morphine to three
OL,21,Fdifferent women, including Gomes.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
